zuslothdb bundles, under src/vendor/libzugodb, its engine libzugodb and
the third-party code it carries. They are copied by tools/vendor.R from

  https://github.com/pedrobtz/libzugodb

at the release tools/vendor.yaml (installed as vendor.yaml) names.
libzugodb is derived from SlothDB,

  https://github.com/SouravRoy-ETL/slothdb
  commit 8180f215847015944c935f56f008d194e2c1494c

with the changes its CHANGELOG.md lists. Each component keeps its own
licence, whose full text is in the file named.

